{#
    Tabler Mention — an inline chip inside running text pointing at a person, a
    tag, an app or a color (`.mention`).

    Renders a <span> by default, or an <a> when `href` is set — a chip that
    links somewhere must be a link to be reachable by keyboard.

    All-in-one:
        Hey <twig:Tabler:Mention label="JohnDoe" prefix="@" prefixHidden avatar="/avatars/john.jpg" href="/u/john" />, have you seen this?
        <twig:Tabler:Mention label="GitHub" logo="/brands/github.svg" href="https://github.com" />
        <twig:Tabler:Mention label="#066fd1" swatch="blue" />
        <twig:Tabler:Mention label="WebDevelopment" prefix="#" count="16" href="/tags/web" />

    Composed (override `content`, or just the `leading` / `label` / `count` blocks):
        <twig:Tabler:Mention href="/u/jane">
            <twig:Tabler:Mention:Avatar image="/avatars/jane.jpg" />
            <span class="visually-hidden">@</span>JaneSmith
        </twig:Tabler:Mention>

    Accessibility: the avatar, logo and swatch carry no text, so the label must
    say who or what the chip is. Keep the @ or # sign, visually hidden with
    `prefixHidden` when the design drops it.

    Props:
      label         — the chip text; mirrored by the `label` block
      href          — when set, renders <a href>
      prefix        — sign before the label, e.g. @ or #
      prefixHidden  — keep the prefix for assistive technology only (visually-hidden)
      avatar        — round picture URL of a person (Mention:Avatar)
      logo          — square logo URL of an app or a brand (Mention:App)
      swatch        — color swatch, any color accepted by Mention:Color (Mention:Color)
      count         — muted number at the end; mirrored by the `count` block
#}
{% props
    label = null,
    href = null,
    prefix = null,
    prefixHidden = false,
    avatar = null,
    logo = null,
    swatch = null,
    count = null,
%}

{% set tag = href is not null ? 'a' : 'span' %}
<{{ tag }}{% if href is not null %} href="{{ href }}"{% endif %} {{ attributes.defaults({class: 'mention'}).without('href') }}>
    {%- block content -%}
        {%- block leading -%}
            {%- if avatar is not null -%}<twig:Tabler:Mention:Avatar image="{{ avatar }}" />{%- endif -%}
            {%- if logo is not null -%}<twig:Tabler:Mention:App image="{{ logo }}" />{%- endif -%}
            {%- if swatch is not null -%}<twig:Tabler:Mention:Color variant="{{ swatch }}" />{%- endif -%}
        {%- endblock -%}
        {%- block label -%}
            {%- if prefix is not null -%}
                {%- if prefixHidden -%}<span class="visually-hidden">{{ prefix }}</span>{%- else -%}{{ prefix }}{%- endif -%}
            {%- endif -%}
            {{- label -}}
        {%- endblock -%}
        {%- block count -%}
            {%- if count is not null -%}<twig:Tabler:Mention:Count>{{ count }}</twig:Tabler:Mention:Count>{%- endif -%}
        {%- endblock -%}
    {%- endblock -%}
</{{ tag }}>
